---
import Gallery from '../../layouts/Gallery.astro';
import Related from '../../components/Related.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Gallery title="Pattern: settings &amp; admin">
  <p class="demo-note">
    <strong>Who uses it</strong>: a workspace admin, occasionally a first-time
    setup wizard. <strong>How often</strong>: rarely per person, but every
    workspace has one. <strong>What "done" looks like</strong>: a section's
    values saved, or an unsaved change clearly marked before the admin
    navigates away. Composed entirely from existing components —
    <code>.bo-tabs</code> to split General/Users/Notifications,
    <code>.bo-form-section</code> fieldsets, <code>.bo-checkbox</code> for
    on/off preferences (there is no separate "switch" component — a labeled
    checkbox already covers the same setting, per the "one component, many
    settings" principle), and the data table for the user list. Nothing new
    to learn.
    <strong>Not for a single end user's own preferences</strong> — this
    screen is workspace-wide configuration an admin changes for everyone
    (tabs, a member list, org defaults). One person editing their own
    notification or display preferences needs none of that surface; use a
    plain <a href={base + '/patterns/detail-form'}>detail form</a> scoped to
    that person instead.
  </p>
  <section class="demo">
    <div class="bo-tabs">
      <div class="bo-tabs__list" role="tablist" aria-label="Workspace settings">
        <button class="bo-tabs__tab" role="tab" id="sa-t-general" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="sa-p-general">General</button>
        <button class="bo-tabs__tab" role="tab" id="sa-t-users" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sa-p-users">Users</button>
        <button class="bo-tabs__tab" role="tab" id="sa-t-notifications" tabindex="-1" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sa-p-notifications">Notifications</button>
      </div>

      <div class="bo-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="sa-p-general" aria-labelledby="sa-t-general" tabindex="0">
        <form novalidate>
          <fieldset class="bo-form-section">
            <legend class="bo-form-section__legend">Workspace</legend>
            <div class="bo-form-row">
              <div class="bo-form-field">
                <label class="bo-form-field__label" for="sa-name">Workspace name</label>
                <input class="bo-input" id="sa-name" value="Acme Logistics" />
              </div>
              <div class="bo-form-field">
                <label class="bo-form-field__label" for="sa-tz">Time zone</label>
                <select class="bo-select" id="sa-tz">
                  <option>UTC</option>
                  <option selected>America/New_York</option>
                  <option>Asia/Singapore</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="bo-form-field">
                <label class="bo-form-field__label" for="sa-density">Default density</label>
                <select class="bo-select" id="sa-density">
                  <option>Comfortable</option>
                  <option selected>Compact</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <fieldset class="bo-form-section">
            <legend class="bo-form-section__legend">Defaults</legend>
            <div class="bo-choice">
              <input class="bo-checkbox" type="checkbox" id="sa-require-2fa" checked />
              <label for="sa-require-2fa">Require two-factor authentication for all members</label>
            </div>
            <div class="bo-choice">
              <input class="bo-checkbox" type="checkbox" id="sa-auto-archive" />
              <label for="sa-auto-archive">Auto-archive closed purchase orders after 90 days</label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <div class="bo-form-actions">
            <button class="bo-btn bo-btn--secondary" type="button">Cancel</button>
            <button class="bo-btn" type="submit">Save changes</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="bo-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="sa-p-users" aria-labelledby="sa-t-users" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <div class="bo-data-table-container" tabindex="0">
          <table class="bo-data-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th scope="col">Name</th>
                <th scope="col">Role</th>
                <th scope="col">Status</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <p class="bo-byline"><span class="bo-avatar bo-byline__avatar" aria-hidden="true">JD</span> Jordan Diaz</p>
                </td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge bo-badge--accent">Admin</span></td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge bo-badge--success">Active</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <p class="bo-byline"><span class="bo-avatar bo-byline__avatar" aria-hidden="true">RK</span> Rina Kapoor</p>
                </td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge">Member</span></td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge bo-badge--success">Active</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <p class="bo-byline"><span class="bo-avatar bo-byline__avatar" aria-hidden="true">TS</span> Tom Silva</p>
                </td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge">Member</span></td>
                <td><span class="bo-badge bo-badge--warning">Invited</span></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bo-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="sa-p-notifications" aria-labelledby="sa-t-notifications" tabindex="0" hidden>
        <fieldset class="bo-form-section">
          <legend class="bo-form-section__legend">Email alerts</legend>
          <div class="bo-choice">
            <input class="bo-checkbox" type="checkbox" id="sa-notify-po" checked />
            <label for="sa-notify-po">New purchase order submitted for approval</label>
          </div>
          <div class="bo-choice">
            <input class="bo-checkbox" type="checkbox" id="sa-notify-overdue" checked />
            <label for="sa-notify-overdue">Order overdue for receipt</label>
          </div>
          <div class="bo-choice">
            <input class="bo-checkbox" type="checkbox" id="sa-notify-digest" />
            <label for="sa-notify-digest">Weekly digest summary</label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="bo-u-text-muted"><strong>Tabs require <code>initTabs()</code></strong> —
      wired below, same as every other tabbed page.</p>
  </section>
  <script>
    import { initTabs } from '@busy-office/ui/js';
    initTabs();
  </script>

  <section class="demo">
    <h2>Anatomy</h2>
    <ol class="bo-stack bo-stack--tight docs-list">
      <li><strong>Section navigation</strong> — tabs or a sub-sidebar; each section is its own form and saves independently.</li>
      <li><strong>Form sections</strong> — <code>.bo-form-section</code> fieldsets grouping related settings.</li>
      <li><strong>Save bar</strong> — sticky <code>.bo-form-actions</code>, scoped to the current section.</li>
      <li><strong>Danger zone</strong> — destructive settings visually separated, each behind a confirm dialog. Not shown in the demo below (nothing in this workspace's settings is destructive); the contract is specified in this page's Data contract section, under the reset endpoint, for a screen that needs one.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="demo">
    <h2>Data contract</h2>
    <div class="bo-data-table-container" tabindex="0">
      <table class="bo-data-table" data-density="compact">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Request</th><th scope="col">Returns / on failure</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td class="bo-data-table__col--code">GET /settings/:section</td><td>the section form with current values</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="bo-data-table__col--code">POST /settings/:section</td><td>the section re-rendered with a success banner; 422 → the same form with field errors and values kept</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="bo-data-table__col--code">POST /settings/:section/reset</td><td>defaults restored — behind a confirm dialog, never a bare button</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo">
    <h2>States</h2>
    <div class="bo-data-table-container" tabindex="0">
      <table class="bo-data-table" data-density="compact">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">State</th><th scope="col">What ships</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Saved</td><td>a success alert in the section, not a global toast — the user needs to know WHICH section saved</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Unsaved changes</td><td>a dirty marker in the save bar; warn on section switch, not just on unload</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Validation error</td><td>field-level messages; focus the first invalid control</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Read-only (non-admin)</td><td>render values as <a href={base + '/components/kv'}>key-value facts</a> and omit the save bar</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Destructive action <span class="bo-u-text-muted">(not in this demo)</span></td><td>confirm dialog naming the exact consequence and requiring the object name typed for irreversible ones</td></tr>
          <tr><td>No JS</td><td>the tabbed sections need <code>initTabs()</code> to switch panels — without it, whichever panel the server marked visible (not <code>hidden</code>) is the only one reachable, since the inactive tabs' panels carry a static <code>hidden</code> attribute and clicking a tab does nothing</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="demo">
    <h2>Components used</h2>
    <p class="bo-u-text-muted"><span class="bo-badge">complexity 2 of 4</span></p>
    <ul class="bo-cluster docs-list-bare">
      <li><a class="bo-badge bo-badge--type" href={base + '/components/form'}>Forms</a></li>
      <li><a class="bo-badge bo-badge--type" href={base + '/components/tabs'}>Tabs</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <Related links={[
    ["/components/tabs", "Tabs"],
    ["/components/form", "Forms"],
    ["/components/data-table", "Data table"],
    ["/components/byline", "Byline"],
    ["/patterns/detail-form", "Detail form (edit-screen counterpart)"],
  ]} />
</Gallery>
